# ArbSwap frontend RPC configuration (all optional).
#
# The app defaults to public Devnet. Set these at build time (Vite exposes only
# VITE_* variables to the browser). NEVER put secrets or API keys here — browser
# env vars are public.
#
# VITE_ARBSWAP_CLUSTER=devnet              # devnet (default) | mainnet
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
# VITE_SOLANA_RPC_FALLBACKS=https://your-devnet-fallback.example
